{
  "_doc": "CMS HRRP penalties + HHS-OIG CIA status for in-sample (FY2024) and blind (FY2017) universes. CMS HRRP supplemental data file URLs return FY2021 file only via CMS active links; archived FY2024/FY2017 supplemental files (xlsx in zip) were not retrievable within search budget. KFF Health News maintains a public lookup tool but does not publish a direct CSV. Consequently, individual hospital HRRP penalty percentages are marked LOW confidence (data_unavailable=true). HHS-OIG CIA status verified via targeted name searches against the public CIA database (https://oig.hhs.gov/compliance/corporate-integrity-agreements/browse-cias/) and corroborating DOJ/OIG press releases.",
  "verified_at": "2026-05-27",
  "methodology": {
    "cms_hrrp_data_collection_status": "BLOCKED - CMS supplemental data zip URL https://www.cms.gov/files/zip/hospital-readmissions-reduction-program-supplemental-data-file.zip returns FY2021 file; FY2024 and FY2017 archived supplemental files require navigation to per-fiscal-year archived pages with timeout-prone slow loads. CMS provider-data API (dataset 9n3s-kdb3) exposes measure-level data (excess readmission ratios) but does NOT expose payment_adjustment_factor field needed for penalty % calculation. KFF Health News interactive tool lacks public CSV/JSON endpoint. Result: HRRP penalty % marked LOW with data_unavailable=true for all obligors. Universe-level program stats only: FY2024 - 39 hospitals at max 3.00% penalty nationally (~1.5% of penalized hospitals); avg penalty 0.64% (among penalized).",
    "cia_search_strategy": "Targeted WebSearch on each obligor name + 'Corporate Integrity Agreement' / 'False Claims Act' / 'OIG settlement'. CIA list nationally is small (~115 active, ~327 total in OIG database). Most acute-care hospital systems are not under CIA. Active CIAs in the obligor universe were verified by cross-referencing DOJ press releases with OIG enforcement pages.",
    "windows": {
      "in_sample_cia_window": "2022-12-31 to 2025-03-31",
      "in_sample_hrrp_fy": "FY2024 (Oct 2023 - Sept 2024)",
      "blind_cia_window": "2016-12-31 to 2019-12-31",
      "blind_hrrp_fy": "FY2017 (Oct 2016 - Sept 2017)"
    }
  },
